<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9054] ScanQuery responses are serialized with Optimized Marshaller</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9054</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When you do ContinuousQuery on a cache, its initial query sends results via OptimizedMarshaller (which has binary compatibility implications) but its continuous part uses BinaryMarshaller. They should both be using BinaryMarshaller. Fix seems to be one-liner, see patch and userlist thread.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13173799">IGNITE-9054</key>
